  </p>

  <div class="honest-take">
    <p class="honest-take__label">Two stages of competition</p>
    <p>
      Several aviation doors have a hard entry filter and a separate hard step later. A pilot clears training and exams, then competes for an airline seat. An air traffic controller clears a written test, then a voice test, psychological checks and a medical. Clearing the first filter does not clear the second, so plan for both.
    </p>
